msgid "An optional card anyone in a live session can pull at the start, as often as they like. It reads today's sky in both Human Design and Western astrology, weaves in the Gene Keys of the people present who said yes, names each person, and offers the room a few ways to hold the session. Each person's own line stays private until they share it, and the cards are deleted when the session closes."
